1
00:00:03,378 --> 00:00:05,213
Looks like

2
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:07,007
you've made up.

3
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:09,009
We're here to end it.

4
00:00:11,302 --> 00:00:13,680
Tell the truth.

5
00:00:14,347 --> 00:00:18,810
You're “Wild Stallion”
aren't you?

6
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:24,858
That's right.

7
00:00:26,776 --> 00:00:29,779
What are the odds, huh?

8
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:31,990
That's why

9
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,242
I planned everything.
To drive you apart.

10
00:00:34,242 --> 00:00:35,326
Are you out of your mind?

11
00:00:35,326 --> 00:00:37,620
I used everything

12
00:00:37,829 --> 00:00:40,623
you ever told me.

13
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:43,126
Even the stuff I said
about Ji-sung...

14
00:00:43,126 --> 00:00:44,627
Yeah, I knew it all.

15
00:00:45,045 --> 00:00:46,671
Your crush on him.

16
00:00:46,671 --> 00:00:47,589
Your jealousy. Everything.

17
00:00:47,589 --> 00:00:49,215
How could you do that?

18
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:51,885
Because of love.

19
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:54,512
Because I love you.

20
00:00:54,512 --> 00:00:55,680
So you hurting me
was also...

21
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,558
Yeah. I figured once
you were out of the picture

22
00:00:58,558 --> 00:01:02,937
Ji-sung would come back to me.

23
00:01:02,937 --> 00:01:06,232
You really think
that makes sense?

24
00:01:07,901 --> 00:01:11,321
You still don't get it
do you?

25
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:15,200
You can't
give up on me, Ji-sung.

26
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:18,787
You've lost it.

27
00:01:19,621 --> 00:01:22,332
Even after all this
you can't push me away.

28
00:01:22,332 --> 00:01:24,751
Why do you think that is?

29
00:01:24,751 --> 00:01:26,127
What the hell
is wrong with you?

30
00:01:26,127 --> 00:01:27,462
See?

31
00:01:27,462 --> 00:01:30,840
He still can't push me away.
